  <para unique="1091606" format="xIndent1">EVEX-encoded instruction, see <link unique="1091604" linkend="&lt;c&gt;__sdm_vol2A_ch02.fm#79250: 06_Table: Table 2-49. Type E4 Class Exception Conditions" xrefstyle="Table All - no page-period">Table&#160;2&#8209;51, &#8220;Type E4 Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</link></para>
  </subsection>
 </instruction>
